    description: "Scala and Groovy analyzers extract meta.base_classes but emit no extends/implements edges. Java and Kotlin do emit these edges. The inheritance linker (linkers/inheritance.py) can create edges from meta.base_classes but only if the analyzer also registers them. Fix: add _extract_inheritance_edges to scala.py and groovy.py. Violates META-sulor (Metadata Must Become Graph Structure)."  # 5903
